BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:eva-london-2027-call-for-proposals@artificialnouveau.github.io
DTSTAMP:20261104T150945Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270111
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270112
SUMMARY:Deadline: EVA London 2027: Call for Proposals (Electronic Visualisa
 tion and the Arts\, 12-16 July 2027)
DESCRIPTION:EVA London is a long-running hybrid conference on electronic vi
 sualisation and the arts\, covering digital art\, creative technology\, co
 mputing and visual culture\, held at BCS in Moorgate\, London\, and online
 .\n\nOrganisation: EVA London (BCS Computer Arts Society)\nLocation: BCS L
 ondon offices\, Moorgate\, London\, UK\, and online via Zoom (hybrid). Ope
 n internationally.\nAward: NO CASH\, listed as an exception at the editor'
 s request (conference presentation slot and publication in the proceedings
 ). Free to submit\, but at least one author of each paper and all panel an
